AirPlay Volume Bridge includes original integration code and patches to:

Shairport Sync 5.6.3
https://github.com/mikebrady/shairport-sync
Copyright Mike Brady and contributors. Main license: MIT.
Additional component licenses are retained in the upstream LICENSES directory.
The build downloads the unmodified release archive and verifies its SHA-256.

The source distribution does not include Shairport Sync, Homebrew libraries,
or their compiled binaries. Local builds link to separately installed FFmpeg,
OpenSSL, libconfig and popt. Each dependency retains its own license.
Redistributing compiled binaries requires reviewing the licenses of the actual
linked dependencies, including the configuration of the FFmpeg build.

